expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=([2-9]|[1-9][0-9]) prefab=-581295882
chat .devunits 2136899683 60 mix-spider
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=([2-9]|[1-9][0-9]) prefab=2136899683
chat .devunits 2103131615 60 mix-spider
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=([2-9]|[1-9][0-9]) prefab=2103131615
chat .devunits 574276383 60 mix-spider
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=([2-9]|[1-9][0-9]) prefab=574276383
chat .devunits -548489519 60 mix-spider
